# Install Obot Sentry on macOS

Manually install `obot-sentry` to run one-off scans or install hooks
yourself.

1. Open Terminal and install the binary:

   ```sh
   sudo install -m 755 obot-sentry /usr/local/bin/obot-sentry
   ```

2. Configure Obot Sentry, replacing `REPLACE_WITH_ENROLLMENT_KEY` with your
   enrollment key:

   ```sh
   export OBOT_SENTRY_SERVER_URL="{{.serverURL}}"
   export OBOT_SENTRY_ENROLLMENT_KEY="REPLACE_WITH_ENROLLMENT_KEY"
   export OBOT_SENTRY_SCAN_INTERVAL_MINUTES="{{.scanIntervalMinutes}}"
   ```

## Run a scan

```sh
obot-sentry scan --submit
```

## Install hooks

```sh
sudo obot-sentry hook-install
```

## Uninstall

```sh
sudo rm -f /usr/local/bin/obot-sentry
```
